## Symptom

relay_client.maybe_annotate_protocol_skew (relay_client.ml:506-528) fires an extra GET /health after ANY non-transport error response - including 429s - deepening the very rate-limit bucket that produced the error and doubling latency; net_ctx_of_bundle (196-214) re-reads and re-parses the CA PEM per request. CLI-side only, but monitor/whoami loops amplify throttling.

## Fix direction

Cache the health/compat verdict per client; build the conduit ctx once.

## Evidence

Connector review 2026-09-17.